### ==============================================================================
### FASE 6: REST API CLIENT (REALISASI JURNAL BUKU BESAR)
### Format: VS Code REST Client
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api

### 1. Ambil Token CSRF
# @name getCsrf
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/csrf
Content-Type: application/json

###
@csrfToken = {{getCsrf.response.body.csrf_token}}

### 2. Login sebagai Akuntansi (Dya Putri)
# @name loginAkuntansi
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "dya@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Unggah File Realisasi (Mode replace_month) - Akuntansi
# Respons 202 Accepted dengan ID batch
# @name uploadRealisasi
POST {{baseUrl}}/realization-imports
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="company_code"

CN
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mode"

replace_month
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="dummy_daftar_jurnal.xlsx"
Content-Type: application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet

< ./../../backend/tests/fixtures/dummy_daftar_jurnal.xlsx
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###
@batchId = {{uploadRealisasi.response.body.data.batch_id}}

### 4. Cek Progres & Status Batch
GET {{baseUrl}}/realization-imports/{{batchId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Riwayat Batch Import Realisasi (Paginasi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/realization-imports?company_code=CN&page=1&per_page=10
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Daftar Unit yang Belum Terpetakan pada Batch
GET {{baseUrl}}/realization-imports/{{batchId}}/unmapped-units
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Rincian Baris Galat (Unit Tidak Dikenal / Pemakaian Barang Tak Terbaca)
GET {{baseUrl}}/realization-imports/{{batchId}}/errors?page=1&per_page=20
Content-Type: application/json

### 8. Tambah / Petakan Alias Unit ke Unit Sistem
# Otomatis memetakan ulang baris unmapped pada batch berstatus PREVIEW
PUT {{baseUrl}}/unit-aliases
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "company_code": "CN",
  "alias_name": "KLINIK SG SATELIT",
  "unit_id": 1
}

### 9. Konfirmasi Batch Import (PREVIEW -> CONFIRMED)
# Tolak 409 Conflict bila masih ada unmapped units
POST {{baseUrl}}/realization-imports/{{batchId}}/confirm
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

### 10. Rollback / Batalkan Batch Import (Menghapus Baris Jurnal Batch)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/realization-imports/{{batchId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

### 11. Ambil Realisasi Buku Besar - Agregasi per COA (BR-05)
GET {{baseUrl}}/realizations?group_by=coa&start_month=2026-10&end_month=2026-10
Content-Type: application/json

### 12. Ambil Realisasi Buku Besar - Agregasi per Unit Kerja
GET {{baseUrl}}/realizations?group_by=unit&company_code=CN
Content-Type: application/json

### 13. Ambil Realisasi Buku Besar - Agregasi per Bulan
GET {{baseUrl}}/realizations?group_by=month&year=2026
Content-Type: application/json

### 14. Ambil Realisasi Buku Besar - Agregasi per Pemakaian Barang
GET {{baseUrl}}/realizations?group_by=item
Content-Type: application/json

### 15. Login sebagai PIC (Rina Pratiwi - Akses hanya Unit 1 MCU)
# @name loginPIC
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "email": "rina@ptcn.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 16. Tes Isolasi Unit (PIC Rina hanya melihat realisasi unit miliknya)
GET {{baseUrl}}/realizations?group_by=unit
Content-Type: application/json
